license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/trashchenkov/power-systems-agent-benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Executable benchmark and paper artifact package for evaluating tool-using AI
  agents in electric power engineering. The release contains benchmark code,
  public executable task families, deterministic evaluators and baselines,
  public reference-run submissions/results/logs, public model-harness grid
  artifacts, held-out generator validation, and aggregate-only held-out
  summaries.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - agent benchmark
  - electric power engineering
  - power systems
  - executable evaluation
  - held-out evaluation
